// Dialog :
"P211635286" "Man, being a hypocrite and partying with chicks is one thing, but geez, this guy is such a total sleaze. I mean, yeah, selling out secrets like this helps out Arachnos and all, but it's just low. Me, I try to keep some class, you know. Kinda like Mr. Sonata."
// RandomFameString :
"P82091537" "I saw an APB go out on {VillainName} from Arachnos, but then it went away.  Like THAT. {VillainName} must have some friends."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P770365985" "So, Johnny asks me if you've ever actually met Councilman Wenkler. I told him I didn't think you had, and then Johnny, he says that he thinks you should. Now, what Mr. Sonata tells me is that our pal Wenkler got tipped that we're digging up all this dirt, so he pulled some strings, and now he's got this squad of those uptight Longbow types coming in to get him out of the islands. Johnny, he doesn't like that. He says if Councilman Wenkler gets a free out, he might feel too safe. So, Johnny, he wants you to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>bring Mr. Wenkler back to us before those Longbow guys can get him out of St. Martial.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4142021002" "Kidnap Councilman Wenkler from his Longbow extraction team"
// SendOffString :
"P3849797896" "See, me, I'm more of a live-and-let live kind of guy. I like to be laid back, and I'd figure we already got enough dirt on this guy. But, Johnny, he's more aggressive. He's a take-charge kind of guy. His big thing is, if this guy gets away like this, then he feels like he's safe. But if we grab him, then deliver him back to Paragon City ourselves, well, he knows we got him. Right now those Longbow cats have Mr. Wenkler in some kind of crazy underwater base, but Johnny already knows all about it. He's even chartered a sub for you over in Nerva Archipelago."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4060764487" "Kidnap Councilman Wenkler"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3354552012" "Johnny told me he plans to take Mr. Wenkler to the mainland himself. Get some photos taken, that kind of thing. That Johnny's the man, {VillainName}. He's a real class act."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2392531466" "You have to wonder how many of these Longbow bases are hidden in the waters of the Rogue Isles."

